This is a private, personal documentation repository. No license to use, copy, modify,
merge, publish, distribute, sublicense or sell any part of it is granted.

It describes a setup that wires together third-party software, including but not limited to
Claude Code (Anthropic), the Codex CLI (OpenAI), the Antigravity CLI (Google), Graphify, Jev
(TypeSafe) and community Claude Code plugins. None of that software is included here, and
nothing in this repository grants or alters any right to it. Each of those projects remains
governed by its own license, held by its own authors.

No open source license is applied on purpose: relicensing third-party material would be
incorrect, and the alternative of picking a permissive license for documentation that
describes someone else's tools would imply rights that do not exist.
